        path, fileStatuses.size(), getTotalFileBytes(), estimateRowCount(),
        hasExactRowCount() ? "footer" : "estimated");
```

(`LOG` already exists in the class, cf. `:617`.) This line is how the SF1000 arm proves which path each table took.

